s//2)）安装 guard 后允许匹配，unbacked 符号直接返回 False 且不落 guard。对 _meta_matches、guard_or_false 执行 git grep，torch_npu 中无这两个符号的直接引用，但 torch_npu/npu/npugraph_ex/__init__.py:24 的 register_replacement 把 NPU 推理图变换建立在上游 pattern matcher 之上，torch_npu/_inductor/fx_passes/fav3_partition_pass.py:18 也直接 import pattern_matcher 的匹配原语，NPU 图上的 pattern 匹配全部经过 _meta_matches。语义变化：动态 shape 下 NPU 的 post-grad 与自定义 pattern 会在原先拒绝的位置生成带 guard 的匹配，编译期守卫数量与重编译行为随之变化。验证方法：在 NPU 上以动态 shape 模型运行 torch_npu/_inductor 的 pattern 相关用例（含 fav3 partition 与 npugraph_ex 注册的替换），核对新增守卫与匹配命中结果符合预期。潜在隐患：guard_or_false 在匹配期触发 shape env 求值，NPU 图上未具体化表达式会使匹配耗时上升或在守卫评估处抛出被吞掉的异常。","cann_dependency":"否","ci_status":"","ci_run_url":"","ci_error_reason":"","ci_analysis":null,"ci_test_comparisons":[],"ci_counts":null,"ci_test_items":[],"ci_env":"","ci_source_status":"缺文档","ci_execution_status":"未获取结果","ci_baseline_status":"未核验","ci_regression":"不可判定","ci_sources":[],"verification_history":[],"source_file":"analysis_2026-10-10_2026-10-10.json"},{"pr_number":200284,"pr_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/200284","title":"[torch] Key Dynamo's ExtraState API on the code object (#200284)","commit_date":"2026-10-09","version":"2.16.0","module":"图模式·aclgraph后端","function_module":"图模式·aclgraph后端","impact_tag":"Check","priority":"medium","status":"PENDING_VERIFICATION","need_adaptation":"否","need_verification":"是","summary":"Dynamo C++ 侧 ExtraState 各入口改为传入 code 对象自行查找状态，移除跨回调持有的裸指针。","impact_analysis":"真实 diff 显示改动集中在 torch/csrc/dynamo/extra_state.cpp/.h 与 eval_frame_cpp.cpp（627 行）：lookup、try_lookup_without_guard_eval、has_relevant_cache_entries、get_compile_inputs、record_compile_result、get_frame_exec_strategy、set_code_exec_strategy 全部改为以 PyCodeObject 为首参自行解析 ExtraState，删除 extract_cache_entry/create_cache_entry 旧入口，ExtraState 生命周期与 code 对象绑定，对外行为除回调返回后重读 slot 一次外不变。对上述符号执行 git grep，torch_npu 中未使用这些 C++ 接口；torch_npu/utils/_dynamo.py:1119 仅引用 Python 层 torch._dynamo.eval_frame._TorchDynamoContext，该公共包装的签名与行为未变。NPU 的 torch.compile 缓存查找随上游整体切换到新入口，属 C++ 内部重构。需 review 的点：precompile_entries 的 fast-path 从遍历收窄为仅检查首项，隔离重编译多入口场景下的命中顺序是否与 NPU 的 reset_code/重编译用法兼容。验证方法：在 NPU 上运行 torch_npu 的 dynamo 编译冒烟（含重复编译、reset_code、isolate 场景），核对缓存命中与重编译次数符合基线。潜在隐患：free-threaded 构建下 code 对象 slot 的读写时序变化在 GIL 之外才可见，现有 NPU 测试对该场景覆盖有限。","cann_dependency":"否","ci_status":"","ci_run_url":"","ci_error_reason":"","ci_analysis":null,"ci_test_comparisons":[],"ci_counts":null,"ci_test_items":[],"ci_env":"","ci_source_status":"缺文档","ci_execution_status":"未获取结果","ci_baseline_status":"未核验","ci_regression":"不可判定","ci_sources":[],"verification_history":[],"source_file":"analysis_2026-10-10_2026-10-10.json"},{"pr_number":200204,"pr_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/200204","title":"[jit] Add stacklevel=2 to TorchScript deprecation warnings.","commit_date":"2026-10-09","version":"2.16.0","module":"图模式·aclgraph后端","function_module":"图模式·aclgraph后端","impact_tag":"Monitor","priority":"low","status":"PENDING_VERIFICATION","need_adaptation":"否","need_verification":"否","summary":"torch.jit 弃用告警统一加 stacklevel=2，告警归属调用方行号且各调用点独立打印，属告警行为层变化。","impact_analysis":"此 PR 修改 TorchScript 弃用告警：torch/jit/_script.py、_trace.py、_serialization.py、_freeze.py、_async.py 共 17 处 warnings.warn 新增 stacklevel=2（17 行改动），使 FutureWarning 指向用户调用行而非 torch/jit/ 内部，且默认 filter 去重粒度从每进程一条变为每调用点一条。对 torch.jit.script、warnings.warn 执行 git grep：torch_npu/contrib/transfer_to_npu.py:314 保存 _real_jit_script 并在 :342-343 将 torch.jit.script/script_method 替换为自带 _jit_script 包装与独立告警。torch_npu 的 JIT 融合（torch_npu/jit/fusion_pass）与 transfer_to_npu 的禁用包装均为独立实现，不依赖上游告警的 stacklevel 归属；NPU 用户经 transfer_to_npu 迁移时看到的是其自身 RuntimeWarning，上游 stacklevel 变化只影响未迁移场景的告警展示次数与行号。不影响 NPU 功能。","cann_dependency":"","ci_status":"","ci_run_url":"","ci_error_reason":"","ci_analysis":null,"ci_test_comparisons":[],"ci_counts":null,"ci_test_items":[],"ci_env":"","ci_source_status":"缺文档","ci_execution_status":"未获取结果","ci_baseline_status":"未核验","ci_regression":"不可判定","ci_sources":[],"verification_history":[],"source_file":"analysis_2026-10-09_2026-10-09.json"},{"pr_number":200196,"pr_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/200196","title":"[FSDP2] Keep the unsharded grad_dtype fixed across forward and backward","commit_date":"2026-10-09","version":"2.16.0","module":"分布式·FSDP/Shard/DTensor","function_module":"分布式·FSDP/Shard/DTensor","impact_tag":"Test","priority":"high","status":"PENDING_VERIFICATION","need_adaptation":"是","need_verification":"是","summary":"FSDP2 混精度 grad_dtype 选择移至 pre_forward 并保持到 post_backward，梯度 dtype 时序变化。","impact_analysis":"此 PR 修改 torch/distributed/fsdp/_fully_shard/_fsdp_param.py 与 _fsdp_param_group.py（259 行改动）：梯度延迟上cast的选择从 pre_backward 移到 pre_forward（:638-641）并保持到 post_backward，新增 FSDPParam.defers_grad_upcast 属性与 _restore_unsharded_grad_dtypes（:929），私有列表 _fsdp_params_with_wider_grad_dtype 改名为 _fsdp_params_deferring_grad_upcast，带 fsdp_pre_all_gather 扩展的参数不再延迟。对 _set_unsharded_grad_dtypes、defers_grad_upcast、unsharded_grad_dtype 执行 git grep：torch_npu 中均无匹配，但 torch_npu/distributed/fsdp/__init__.py:1 导出 fully_shard，torch_npu/distributed/fsdp/_add_fsdp_patch.py:10 导入 FSDPParamGroup 并在 :201 对 FSDPParamGroup.__init__ 打补丁、:207-221 替换 DefaultAllGather/DefaultReduceScatter.allocate 与 foreach_reduce（NPU 显存缓存复用）。耦合链路：上游 FSDP2 混精度 grad_dtype 时序 → torch_npu FSDP2 补丁层（_add_fsdp_patch.py:201 包装 init、allocate 补丁）→ NPU fully_shard 训练的梯度 dtype、reduce-scatter 拷入与显存复用行为。影响类型为运行时数值行为变化：NPU bf16 参数 fp32 梯度累加场景中，cast 时点前移使同一 forward/backward 对的 grad_dtype 一致；未同步 microbatch 中多用途参数在 compute dtype（bf16）内求和后由 restore 放宽。验证：NPU 两卡以 MixedPrecisionPolicy(param_dtype=torch.bfloat16) 的 fully_shard 训练，跑梯度跨 step 累加与 zero-bubble weight passes 场景，核对权重梯度 dtype 为 fp32 且数值等于 fp32 累加参考。风险：新增的 all-gather 扩展分支与 torch_npu 显存缓存 allocate 补丁交互，若 NPU 回归未覆盖新时序，出现梯度 dtype 静默回退到 bf16 的精度损失。","cann_dependency":"是","ci_status":"否","ci_run_url":"https://my.feishu.cn/docx/FNvzdOWeEoEeLzxYO8ac6qT1nwe","ci_error_reason":"测试失败：test_norm_modules_fp16（test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py，cuda标签实际NPU）。该批用例无日志，无报错行可引用。对比区基线败1→本次败1同节点；基线未核验，缺两侧日志，回归不可判定。处置：导出飞书原文该分片junit与控制台，补齐两侧同用例报错后重判。","ci_analysis":null,"ci_test_comparisons":[],"ci_counts":{"total":15,"passed":11,"skipped":3,"no_result":0,"failed":1,"error":0},"ci_test_items":[{"name":"test_grad_dtype_chosen_in_forward","file":"test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py","device":"cuda","result":""},{"name":"test_grad_dtype_fixed_for_all_gather_extensions","file":"test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py","device":"cuda","result":""},{"name":"test_grad_dtype_outside_forward_and_backward","file":"test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py","device":"cuda","result":""},{"name":"test_grad_dtype_restored_after_deferred_upcast","file":"test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py","device":"cuda","result":""},{"name":"test_grad_dtype_seen_by_all_gather_extension_compute","file":"test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py","device":"cuda","result":""},{"name":"test_grad_dtype_zero_bubble_weight_passes","file":"test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py","device":"cuda","result":""},{"name":"test_norm_modules_fp16","file":"test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py","device":"cuda","result":"过0 跳0 败1 错0"},{"name":"test_param_dtype_override_fn_is_keyword_only","file":"test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py","device":"cuda","result":"过1 跳0 败0 错0"},{"name":"test_checkpoint_recompute_casts_outputs","file":"test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py","device":"cuda","result":"过0 跳1 败0 错0"},{"name":"test_norm_modules_bf16","file":"test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py","device":"cuda","result":"过0 跳1 败0 错0"},{"name":"test_submodules_with_external_inputs","file":"test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py","device":"cuda","result":"过1 跳0 败0 错0"},{"name":"test_checkpoint_recompute_casts_forward_inputs","file":"test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py","device":"cuda","result":"过0 跳1 败0 错0"},{"name":"test_grad_acc_with_reduce_dtype","file":"test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py","device":"cuda","result":"过1 跳0 败0 错0"},{"name":"test_release_all_gather_state_for_comm_reuse_before_lazy_init","file":"test_fully_shard_comm.py","device":"cuda","result":"过1 跳0 败0 错0"},{"name":"test_get_param_module_infos_list_of_mlps","file":"test_fully_shard_init.py","device":"cuda","result":"过1 跳0 败0 错0"}],"ci_env":"pytorch baeb8a9494 · torch-npu 4370a2cf912f","ci_source_status":"已匹配","ci_execution_status":"已执行·有失败","ci_baseline_status":"未核验","ci_regression":"不可判定","ci_sources":[{"document_id":"FNvzdOWeEoEeLzxYO8ac6qT1nwe","title":"PR#200196","url":"https://my.feishu.cn/docx/FNvzdOWeEoEeLzxYO8ac6qT1nwe","modified_time":"1791524625","read_status":"已读取","evidence_file":"C:\\Users\\ad\\.claude\\skills\\pytorch-pr-analysis\\data\\runs\\2026-10-09\\20261010-083152\\attempt-0\\evidence\\ci-logs\\PR_200196_d4cd2aa1280d8444.txt","sha256":"d4cd2aa1280d8444831fcd6191eeb7f254fd84ee31eda879746f16c91caac27b"}],"verification_history":[{"status":"否","run_url":"https://my.feishu.cn/docx/FNvzdOWeEoEeLzxYO8ac6qT1nwe","error_reason":"测试失败：test_norm_modules_fp16（test_fully_shard_mixed_precision.py，cuda标签实际NPU）。该批用例无日志，无报错行可引用。对比区基线败1→本次败1同节点；基线未核验，缺两侧日志，回归不可判定。处置：导出飞书原文该分片junit与控制台，补齐两侧同用例报错后重判。","test_analysis":null,"test_comparisons":[],"env":"pytorch baeb8a9494 · torch-npu 4370a2cf912f","torch_npu_sha":"","observed_at":1791602498.9787366}],"source_file":"analysis_2026-10-09_2026-10-09.json"},{"pr_number":200174,"pr_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/200174","title":"Register rng prim tags with the dispatcher","commit_date":"2026-10-09","version":"2.16.0","module":"图模式·inductor+triton","function_module":"图模式·inductor+triton","impact_tag":"Test","priority":"medium","status":"PENDING_VERIFICATION","need_adaptation":"是","need_verification":"是","summary":"register_rng_prim 把 tags 透传给 custom_op，使 tag 随 schema 进入 dispatcher，修复 C++ 侧不可见。","impact_analysis":"对 register_rng_prim 执行 git grep，torch_npu/utils/_inductor.py:85 直接调用被改的 register_rng_prim，以 tags=(torch.Tag.nondeterministic_seeded,) 注册 NPU 版 philox_rand prim；该调用位于 patch_register_philox_rand() 内，torch_npu/utils/_inductor.py:94-95 用补丁替换 torch._prims.rng_prims.register_philox_rand 并随即执行注册。上游变更把 tags 传入 custom_op 而非事后覆盖 OpOverload._tags，tag 随 schema 进入 dispatcher：NPU 注册的 philox_rand 从此能被 C++ 侧 OperatorHandle::hasTag 识别为 nondeterministic_seeded，FakeTensor 常量传播会正确跳过该算子（此前 C++ 消费者会误常量传播并触发真实 kernel，报 RNG state must be a torch.ByteTensor 类错误），同时 Python 侧 op.tags 额外出现 custom_op 自动附加的 pt2_compliant_tag。NPU inductor 对 rng_prims 系列的 fallback 注册见 torch_npu/_inductor/ascend_npu_ir/ascend_npu_ir/npu/inductor_patch/lowering.py:2857（run_and_save_rng_state 等 make_fallback），证明 rng_prims 是 NPU 编译链路的活跃依赖面。影响类型为编译期行为变化（RNG 算子功能化与常量传播路径），非 API 签名破坏、非数值变化。验证动作：跑 torch_npu 的 test/test_functionalization_of_rng_ops.py（functionalize_rng_ops=True 下 philox_rand 节点计数与数值）与 test/dynamo/test_higher_order_ops.py 的 philox_rand 用例，并检查 torch.ops.rngprims.philox_rand.default.tags 含 pt2_compliant_tag 后无代码依赖精确 tag 列表（git grep 未发现 torch_npu 有此类断言）。潜在风险：若插件代码仍读取 _tags 私有属性而非 schema tags，会出现 tag 判定分歧导致 RNG 算子被错误常量传播、产生静默错误结果。","cann_dependency":"是","ci_status":"","ci_run_url":"","ci_error_reason":"","ci_analysis":null,"ci_test_comparisons":[],"ci_counts":null,"ci_test_items":[],"ci_env":"","ci_source_status":"缺文档","ci_execution_status":"未获取结果","ci_baseline_status":"未核验","ci_regression":"不可判定","ci_sources":[],"verification_history":[],"source_file":"analysis_2026-10-09_2026-10-09.json"},{"pr_number":200167,"pr_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/200167","title":"[inductor] Don't return FailedMatch with its traceback from PatternExpr.match","commit_date":"2026-10-09","version":"2.16.0","module":"图模式·inductor+triton","function_module":"图模式·inductor+triton","impact_tag":"Test","priority":"low","status":"PENDING_VERIFICATION","need_adaptation":"否","need_verification":"是","summary":"match 失败返回 FailedMatch 时丢弃 traceback，断开调用栈引用环，避免 backward 真实 tensor 滞留循环垃圾。","impact_analysis":"对 FailedMatch、PatternExpr 执行 git grep，torch_npu/npu/npugraph_ex/__init__.py:7 从 torch._inductor.pattern_matcher 导入 PatternExpr/fwd_only 构建 NPU Graph 捕获的 pattern 替换 pass，torch_npu/_inductor/fx_passes/post_grad.py:5 导入 LoweringPatternEntry 注册 NPU post-grad 降级 pattern——这些 pattern 的 match 执行走被改的 PatternExpr.match/MultiOutputPattern.match 路径。上游改为返回 e.with_traceback(None)：match 失败不再把整个调用栈（Inductor 从用户代码深处编译，首次 lazy backward 编译时栈内含 autograd 反向帧与其真实 tensor）经 traceback->f_back 链钉在引用环里，NPU torch.compile 场景下每次首次 backward 后滞留在循环垃圾中的梯度 tensor 随之消除。返回值语义仅 __traceback__ 变为 None，str(e) 文本不变；git grep 确认 torch_npu 源码无读取 FailedMatch traceback 的代码。影响类型为编译期内存行为改善，非 API 破坏。验证动作：跑 torch_npu 的 test/dynamo/test_npugraph_ex.py（使用 pattern_matcher.Match）与 _inductor post-grad pattern 相关 UT，确认 NPU pattern pass 匹配行为无回归。潜在风险：若三方插件依赖 FailedMatch 的 traceback 定位匹配失败位置，升级后会拿到 None。","cann_dependency":"否","ci_status":"否","ci_run_url":"https://my.feishu.cn/docx/Mf7NdJWZKoaB0GxeOczcEsIWnfb","ci_error_reason":"败6例无结果1例（test_pattern_matcher.py，cuda标签NPU）：cat_slice_cat等3例报Device npu not supported，unfuse_bias_zero_beta×2报Scalars are not equal!，test_fn无结果。基线败1→败4另2例1→1未核验，回归不可判定。处置：补NPU wrapper支持或门控。","ci_analysis":null,"ci_test_comparisons":[],"ci_counts":{"total":15,"passed":23,"skipped":0,"no_result":1,"failed":6,"error":0},"ci_test_items":[{"name":"test","file":"test_pattern_matcher.py","device":"cuda","result":"过12 跳0 败4 错0"},{"name":"test_failed_match_drops_traceback","file":"test_pattern_matcher.py","device":"cuda","result":""},{"name":"test_fn","file":"test_pattern_matcher.py","device":"cuda","result":"无结果"},{"name":"test_mixed_mm_cpu","file":"test_pattern_matcher.py","device":"cuda","result":"过1 跳0 败0 错0"},{"name":"test_remove_pointless_clones","file":"test_pattern_matcher.py","device":"cuda","result":"过1 跳0 败0 错0"},{"name":"test_var_std_reduction_dedup","file":"test_pattern_matcher.py","device":"cuda","result":"过1 跳0 败0 错0"},{"name":"test_var_std_reduction_dedup_different_dim","file":"test_pattern_matcher.py","device":"cuda","result":""},{"name":"test_var_std_reduction_dedup_float32","file":"test_pattern_matcher.py","device":"cuda","result":""},{"n