193593,"pr_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/193593","title":"[dynamo] Split UserMethodVariable off UserFunctionVariable to match CPython","commit_date":"2026-09-16","version":"2.15.0","module":"图模式·aclgraph后端","function_module":"图模式·aclgraph后端","impact_tag":"Test","priority":"low","status":"PENDING_VERIFICATION","need_adaptation":"否","need_verification":"是","summary":"Dynamo 拆分 UserMethodVariable：改为组合 im_func/im_self，修复 nonstrict_trace 绑定方法丢 self。","impact_analysis":"本 PR 重构 torch/_dynamo/variables/functions.py（+213 -71）等 12 个 VT 文件：UserMethodVariable 改为继承 BaseUserFunctionVariable 并组合 im_func/im_self，构造签名由 (fn, obj, source_fn) 变为 (im_func, im_self)，source_fn 属性删除，isinstance(vt, UserFunctionVariable) 不再匹配绑定方法，nonstrict_trace 应用于绑定方法时正确捕获接收者而非误绑定首个实参。耦合链路：torch_npu/utils/_dynamo.py:280 的 NpuStreamContextVariable 直接继承被改文件 torch/_dynamo/variables/ctx_manager.py 中的 StreamContextVariable，其继承的 enter/exit 已改为先以 UserFunctionVariable 包装 __enter__/__exit__ 再构造 UserMethodVariable；torch_npu/dynamo/trace_rule.py:94 的 _patch_npu_trace_rules() 将 torch.npu.current_stream 等注册进 torch_name_rule_map，映射结果经被重构的 builder/VT 层（builder.py 同步修改 UserMethodVariable 构造点）包装执行。影响类型：编译期 trace 行为——绑定方法的 guard 信息更完整（函数 source 随 im_func 传递），NPU 上 torch.compile 含绑定方法调用的模型 guard/重编译行为随之变化；torch_npu 用户文档（docs/zh 下 dynamo_nonstrict_trace.md）所述 nonstrict_trace 用法在绑定方法场景由报错变为可用。验证动作：在 npu 设备跑 torch_npu 仓 test/dynamo/test_trace_rules.py（其第 24 行直接 import 被改的 UserFunctionVariable）与 test/dynamo/test_functions.py 的 method/nonstrict_trace 相关用例。潜在风险：依赖『方法 VT 是 UserFunctionVariable 子类』的隐式判断将失效——git grep 确认 torch_npu 源码无 UserMethodVariable 构造与 isinstance 判断，仅测试文件 import UserFunctionVariable（该类仍存在、构造不变），无破坏点。","cann_dependency":"否","ci_status":"","ci_run_url":"","ci_error_reason":"","ci_analysis":null,"ci_test_comparisons":[],"ci_counts":null,"ci_test_items":[],"ci_env":"","ci_source_status":"未记录","ci_execution_status":"未记录","ci_baseline_status":"","ci_regression":"","ci_sources":[],"verification_history"